# krun: run a command in every pod of the workloads you mark, across clusters
Output docs/krun.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "krun nginx -- nginx -s reload"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Space
Sleep 700ms
Space
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "use"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
